  "notes": "{当|あ}たり is the noun form of the verb ⟦{当|あ}たる→当たる：01860_ataru⟧ (to hit, to be correct).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {当|あ}たり⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{出|で}る→出る：00513_deru⟧: to win (in a lottery/game)\n- {大|おお}{当|あ}たり: jackpot, big hit\n- {当|あ}たり⟦{外|はず}れ→外れ：10487_hazure⟧: hit or miss, luck of the draw\n- {当|あ}たりくじ: winning ticket\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{外|はず}れ→外れ：10487_hazure⟧: miss, losing result, dud\n\nWATCH OUT:\nDo not confuse with ⟦{辺|あた}り→辺り：01770_atari⟧ (vicinity, area around), which has the same reading but different kanji and meaning.\n\nUSAGE:\nAlso used figuratively: ⟦{映画|えいが}→映画：02273_eiga⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{当|あ}たり (the movie was a hit), ⟦{天気|てんき}→天気：00582_tenki⟧⟦{予報|よほう}→予報：03668_yohou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{当|あ}たり (the weather forecast was right).",
